A man of the tribe of Naphtali living at the time of Egypt and Wilderness, first mentioned at Gen.46.24; 
son of: Naphtali (H5321); 
brother of: Jahzeel (H3183), Guni (H1476) and Jezer (H3337); also called Shallum at 1Ch.7.13; Shillemite at Num.26.49; 
§ Shillem = "repaid"
son of Naphtali

A man of the tribe of Judah living before Israel's Monarchy, first mentioned at Rut.4.20; 
son of: Nahshon (H5177); 
husband of: Rahab (H7343); 
father of: Boaz (H1162); also called Sala at Luk.3.32; 
§ Salma = "garment"
1) father of Boaz, father-in-law of Ruth, and grandfather of David
1a) also 'Salmon', 'Salmah'

